# First Alliance saber from Lelanai (Darnassus).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: the client files every racial riding spell under one Riding
# skill (SkillLineAbility), so any riding trainer of your faction teaches it:
# Apprentice Riding (skill 75) from level 40, Journeyman Riding (150) at 60.
# Blizzard: learning to ride grants a mount, and training costs 100g at 40 and
# 1,000g at 60 (Kris Zierhut). ItemSparse lists the
# mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60), usable by every race of the
# faction; whether a vendor still wants Exalted with another race's city (the
# Era rule) is server-side and unconfirmed.

step Learn to ride
  zone Darnassus
  tip Jartsam and Lelanai's sabers are in the Cenarion Enclave's riding grounds in Darnassus. At 40 Jartsam teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Alliance race ride these.
  level 40
  train 4753                          -- Jartsam, riding trainer
  skill Riding 75

step Pick a colour
  tip Lelanai sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 4730                         -- Lelanai
  buy 8629 npc 4730 optional          -- Reins of the Striped Nightsaber, 20g
  buy 8631 npc 4730 optional          -- Reins of the Striped Frostsaber, 20g
  buy 8632 npc 4730 optional          -- Reins of the Spotted Frostsaber, 20g
  note Reins of the Striped Dawnsaber is a new Forever saber (level 40, 20g in the client) whose source is not known yet.
